Create folder CCABank in your desktop or any other location.
https://github.com/JohnPhilip80/CCABank
	Code -> Download Zip.
unzip and copy the MyProject folder into CCABank folder.
Open MySql workbench
	Copy sql script from Dump.sql from github. Run the sql queries in MySql. 
	This will create the Database(db_cca_bank), tables with data.
Open Pycharm
	File -> New Project -> Location -> CCABank -> Create button.
	CCABank -> MyProject -> MyProject -> settings.py -> DATABASES -> 'Password' (give ur mysql password).
	Terminal -> pip install Django
	Terminal -> pip install django mysqlclient
	Terminal -> cd MyProject
	Terminal -> python manage.py runserver
